{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17145","headline":"齐优开笼飞去所献楚王鹄 · 崔枢","name":"齐优开笼飞去所献楚王鹄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"受命笼齐鹄，交欢献楚王。\n惠心先巧辩，戢羽见回翔。\n意适清风远，忧除白日长。\n度云摇旧影，过树阅新芳。\n直取名翻重，宁唯好不伤。\n谁言滑稽理，千载戒禽荒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔枢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}